2
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:00,700
裏路地の真ん中で
In the middle of a back alley,

3
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:03,200
慣れない景色と好かない匂いに
surrounded by unfamiliar scenery and a scent I don't like,

4
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:05,100
私は覆われて
I am completely covered...

5
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:07,400
染まっていくんでしょう
...and will probably be dyed in them, right?

6
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,900
私は怖がりで
Because I'm a coward,

7
00:02:18,900 --> 00:02:20,900
知らないことには手をつけず
I won't touch things I don't know.

8
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:23,000
誰かがやって来て
Waiting for someone else to come along...

9
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,300
毒味をするまで待っていた
...and test the poison first.

10
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:27,200
することは単純で
My routine is simple:

11
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:29,800
マニュアル通りの生活を
living life straight from a manual,

12
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:33,900
来る日も淡々と過ごしていた
spending day after day indifferently.

13
00:02:34,200 --> 00:02:36,500
そういやさ そういやさ
Come to think of it, come to think of it,

14
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:38,800
昨日の私もこうだった
yesterday I was just like this too.

15
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,500
そういやさ そういやさ
Come to think of it, come to think of it...

16
00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:45,300
弱い音を吐いてる
Spitting out weaknesses,

17
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:47,300
薄っぺらい人間です
I am such a shallow human being.

18
00:02:47,300 --> 00:02:49,500
一歩前に出るのはやめときます
I'll pass on taking a step forward,

19
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:52,200
絡まれたくはないからさ
because I don't want to get involved with anyone.

20
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:54,200
描いた理想像に
Since the ideal image I drew

21
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:56,200
現実味がないから
lacks any sense of reality,

22
00:02:56,200 --> 00:02:58,300
近づけないよう生きておきます
I'll live to keep my distance from it.

23
00:02:58,300 --> 00:03:00,600
明日も同じよう過ごしておきます
And I'll spend tomorrow the same way too.

24
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:12,100
路地裏の真ん中で
In the middle of the back alley,

25
00:03:12,100 --> 00:03:14,600
いつもの夕日を薄目で眺めて
staring at the usual sunset with squinted eyes,

26
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:16,500
胸の内で呟いた
I muttered in my heart,

27
00:03:16,500 --> 00:03:18,800
いつまで続くだろう
"How long will this go on?"

28
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,300
そういやさ そういやさ
Come to think of it, come to think of it,

29
00:03:21,300 --> 00:03:23,700
昨日も夕飯これだった
yesterday's dinner was this too.

30
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:26,300
そういやさ そういやさ
Come to think of it, come to think of it...

31
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:29,800
臆病でキリが悪い
With endless cowardice,

32
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,900
意気地無し人間です
I am a spineless human being.

33
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:34,200
一歩後ろに下がって逃げておきます
I'll take a step back and run away,

34
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:36,700
目立ちたくなんかないからさ
because I don't want to stand out at all.

35
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:38,700
描いた理想像に
Since the ideal image I drew

36
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:40,700
現実味がないから
lacks any sense of reality,

37
00:03:40,700 --> 00:03:42,800
近づけないよう生きておきます
I'll live to keep my distance from it.

38
00:03:42,800 --> 00:03:45,300
明日も同じよう過ごしておきます
And I'll spend tomorrow the same way too.

39
00:04:05,100 --> 00:04:07,400
弱い音を吐いてる
Spitting out weaknesses,

40
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,500
薄っぺらい人間です
I am such a shallow human being.

41
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:11,700
一歩前に出るのはやめときます//I'll pass on taking a step forward,
I'll pass on taking a step forward,

42
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:14,300
絡まれたくはないからさ
because I don't want to get involved with anyone.

43
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,800
ため息ばっかでさ
Doing nothing but sighing,

44
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:18,800
吸う息足りないの
I don't even have enough breath to inhale.

45
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:21,000
きっとそう上手くはいかないけどさ
Things surely won't go that well, but...

46
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,200
試しにちょっと生きてみよう
...let's try to live just a little bit anyway.

47
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:54,600
鉄の弾が正義の証明
An iron bullet is proof of justice.

48
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:57,600
貫けば 英雄に近づいた
If it pierces through, you're closer to a hero.

49
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:00,000
その目を閉じて
Close your eyes...

50
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:04,508
同じ形同じ体温の悪魔
A devil with the same shape and temperature.

51
00:05:05,408 --> 00:05:08,008
僕はダメであいつはいいの？
Am I no good, but they are fine?

52
00:05:08,008 --> 00:05:10,808
そこに壁があっただけなのに
Even though there was just a wall there.

53
00:05:10,808 --> 00:05:13,708
生まれてしまった 運命嘆くな
Don't lament the fate of being born,

54
00:05:13,708 --> 00:05:16,808
僕らはみんな 自由なんだから
because we are all free.

55
00:05:16,808 --> 00:05:19,808
鳥のように 羽があれば
If we had wings like birds,

56
00:05:19,808 --> 00:05:27,508
どこへだって行けるけど
we could go anywhere,

57
00:05:27,508 --> 00:05:30,408
帰る場所が なければ
but if we have no place to go back to,

58
00:05:30,408 --> 00:05:37,408
きっとどこへも行けない
we surely cannot go anywhere.

59
00:05:37,408 --> 00:05:43,008
ただただ生きるのは嫌だ
I just don't want to live in vain.

60
00:05:43,008 --> 00:05:48,308
世界は残酷だ
The world is cruel,

61
00:05:48,308 --> 00:05:53,608
それでも君を愛すよ
but I still love you.

62
00:05:53,608 --> 00:05:59,008
なにを犠牲にしても
No matter what I sacrifice,

63
00:05:59,008 --> 00:06:04,208
それでも君を守るよ
I will still protect you.

64
00:06:04,208 --> 00:06:08,708
間違いだとしても 疑ったりしない
Even if it's wrong, I won't doubt you.

65
00:06:08,708 --> 00:06:15,008
正しさとは 自分のこと 強く信じることだ
Righteousness is believing in yourself strongly.

66
00:06:23,708 --> 00:06:29,408
鉄の雨が 降り散る情景 テレビの中 映画に見えたんだ
The rain of steel falling looked like a movie on TV.

67
00:06:29,408 --> 00:06:34,908
戦争なんて 愚かな凶暴 関係ない 知らない国の話
War is just foolish violence, an irrelevant story of a foreign country.

68
00:06:34,908 --> 00:06:40,408
それならなんで あいつ憎んで 黒い気持ち 隠しきれない理由
If so, why do I hate them? The reason for my dark feelings I can't hide,

69
00:06:40,408 --> 00:06:43,108
説明だって できやしないんだ
I can't even explain it.

70
00:06:43,108 --> 00:06:48,408
僕らはなんて 矛盾ばっかなんだ
We are nothing but contradictions.

71
00:07:07,508 --> 00:07:18,508
この言葉も 訳されれば 本当の意味は伝わらない
Even these words, if translated, won't convey their true meaning.

72
00:07:18,508 --> 00:07:28,008
信じるのは その目を開いて 触れた世界だけ
All I believe is the world I touched with my eyes wide open.

73
00:07:28,008 --> 00:07:36,508
ただただ生きるのは嫌だ
I just don't want to live in vain.

74
00:07:36,508 --> 00:07:41,808
世界は残酷だ
The world is cruel,

75
00:07:41,808 --> 00:07:47,308
それでも君を愛すよ
but I still love you.

76
00:07:47,308 --> 00:07:52,708
なにを犠牲にしても
No matter what I sacrifice,

77
00:07:52,708 --> 00:07:57,708
それでも君を守るよ
I will still protect you.

78
00:07:57,708 --> 00:08:02,308
選んだ人の影 捨てたものの屍
The shadow of the chosen, the corpses of the discarded.

79
00:08:02,308 --> 00:08:08,008
気づいたんだ 自分の中 育つのは悪魔の子
I realized that what grows inside me is a child of the devil.

80
00:08:08,008 --> 00:08:16,008
正義の裏 犠牲の中 心には悪魔の子
Behind justice, amidst sacrifice, in my heart is a child of the devil.

81
00:08:42,508 --> 00:08:47,208
そっと振り返った軌跡 どうしたって光って
Looking back softly at our path, it shines no matter what.

82
00:08:47,208 --> 00:08:51,008
ありふれた君が いつだってスーパーヒーロー
Ordinary you are always my superhero.

83
00:09:00,508 --> 00:09:05,108
いつもポンコツだった私 飛べなくて未完成
I was always useless, unable to fly and incomplete.

84
00:09:05,108 --> 00:09:10,508
アヒルの子はアヒルのままかもね、なんてさ
"Maybe the ugly duckling will stay a duckling," I said.

85
00:09:10,508 --> 00:09:15,508
らしさ、なんてほっといて 君となんかちょっと似ていて
Never mind being "true to oneself," we are somewhat alike.

86
00:09:15,508 --> 00:09:21,008
デコボコだからジャストに噛み合うパズルピース
Since we're uneven, we fit perfectly like puzzle pieces.

87
00:09:21,008 --> 00:09:26,508
繋げたい 繋げたい 届かない言葉も
I want to connect, I want to connect, even the words that won't reach.

88
00:09:26,508 --> 00:09:31,508
いつかは誰かの何かに成りたいから
Because someday I want to become something to someone.

89
00:09:31,508 --> 00:09:40,508
crazy no lazy 夢の中 夢を見せて
Crazy, no lazy, show me a dream within a dream.

90
00:09:41,008 --> 00:09:42,508
always going

91
00:09:42,508 --> 00:09:46,808
何千回 何万回 膝をついても
No matter how many thousands or tens of thousands of times my knees give out,

92
00:09:46,808 --> 00:09:52,008
最大級 i love you で立ち上がれるから
I can stand back up with the greatest "I love you".

93
00:09:52,008 --> 00:09:57,408
とびきりオーバーな ty
An extraordinarily huge thank you.

94
00:09:57,408 --> 00:10:00,008
消えそうなハッピーも勇気も
Even the happiness and courage that seem to fade away,

95
00:10:00,316 --> 00:10:01,516
振り絞っちゃって
Squeezing it all out...

96
00:10:02,116 --> 00:10:07,416
大失敗も後悔さえ愛せるなら
If I can love even great failures and regrets,

97
00:10:07,816 --> 00:10:13,416
背中には 君という羽
Then on my back are wings called "you."

98
00:10:21,016 --> 00:10:23,216
チックタック追い越して
Overtaking the tick-tock,

99
00:10:23,216 --> 00:10:26,016
いつもと変わらない日常？そうか
Is this just the usual everyday life?

100
00:10:26,016 --> 00:10:29,816
隣で走る君と Release, Release
Running alongside you, release, release,

101
00:10:29,816 --> 00:10:33,216
響き渡る
Resound,

102
00:10:35,416 --> 00:10:38,216
No fiction

103
00:10:41,816 --> 00:10:46,416
君の色が 私を塗り替えて
Your color repaints me,

104
00:10:46,416 --> 00:10:51,316
壊れかけの音で響くから
As it resonates with a half-broken sound.

105
00:10:51,316 --> 00:10:57,416
お伽話の 続きをまだ描きたいんだよ
I still want to draw the sequel to the fairy tale.

106
00:10:58,216 --> 00:11:03,016
palette palette 連れて行くよ
Palette, palette, I'll take you with me.

107
00:11:04,616 --> 00:11:09,016
きっと何千回何万回
Surely thousands, tens of thousands of times,

108
00:11:09,516 --> 00:11:13,016
きっと何千回何万回
Surely thousands, tens of thousands of times,

109
00:11:14,316 --> 00:11:15,516
Always going

110
00:11:15,516 --> 00:11:20,016
何千回何万回 迷い込んでも
Even if I get lost thousands, tens of thousands of times,

111
00:11:20,016 --> 00:11:25,016
最大級 I love you な君がいるから
Because there's you, whom I love to the maximum degree,

112
00:11:25,016 --> 00:11:29,016
更新中 Special な Thank you
Updating a special thank you.

113
00:11:29,816 --> 00:11:31,016
そう、誰だって
Yes, anyone

114
00:11:31,016 --> 00:11:35,516
ラッキーも運命も手繰り寄せて
Can pull in luck and destiny,

115
00:11:35,516 --> 00:11:40,416
もうバイバイも涙も忘れないよ
So I won't forget goodbyes or tears anymore.

116
00:11:40,816 --> 00:11:45,516
飛べなかった私の
On the back of my once-flightless self,

117
00:11:45,816 --> 00:11:48,016
この背中には
On this back of mine,

118
00:11:48,016 --> 00:11:51,516
君という羽
Are wings called "you."

119
00:12:20,016 --> 00:12:25,316
描いた未来の景色がここにある
The scene of the future we drew is right here.

120
00:12:25,416 --> 00:12:30,816
弱さも抱きしめていくから
Since I'll embrace even my weaknesses,

121
00:12:30,816 --> 00:12:35,816
広げた翼が輝いていく
The spread-out wings will keep shining.

122
00:12:35,816 --> 00:12:38,816
旅立とう 私と
Let's embark on a journey, with me.

123
00:12:57,516 --> 00:13:02,016
等身大の私を写していたい、ただ
I want to reflect my true, authentic self, simply.

124
00:13:02,016 --> 00:13:05,516
望む瞬間 衝動になってんだ
The moment I desire, it becomes an impulse.

125
00:13:06,016 --> 00:13:11,216
くだらないとか 曇りきっていく目をして
With eyes clouding over and calling things pointless,

126
00:13:11,816 --> 00:13:15,816
可能性だって夢を見てみたいのに
Even though I want to dream of possibilities.

127
00:13:16,216 --> 00:13:19,816
ずっと分かっていたんだけど
I've always known, but...

128
00:13:19,816 --> 00:13:22,016
言葉は浮ついている 対象に
My words are floating aimlessly towards the target.

129
00:13:22,016 --> 00:13:25,816
大袈裟だって思っているんでしょ
You think it's exaggerated, don't you?

130
00:13:26,516 --> 00:13:29,816
ずっと黙っていたんだけど
I've always stayed silent, but...

131
00:13:29,816 --> 00:13:32,016
心ってやっぱり正直だ
My heart is honest after all.

132
00:13:32,016 --> 00:13:37,016
打ち込まれた色を感じたい気がしている
I feel like I want to experience the infused colors.

133
00:13:38,216 --> 00:13:40,316
ここだよ 響かせて
I'm here, let it resonate.

134
00:13:40,316 --> 00:13:42,516
焦がしたこの場所で
In this place I yearned for,

135
00:13:42,516 --> 00:13:44,516
解けないでいてよ
Please don't fade away.

136
00:13:44,516 --> 00:13:47,016
明かりになっていく
It is turning into a light.

137
00:13:47,416 --> 00:13:53,816
何度も失われた 取り返した意志の強さに
By the strength of my will, repeatedly lost and reclaimed,

138
00:13:53,816 --> 00:13:57,016
誓った
I swore to it.

139
00:14:06,516 --> 00:14:11,816
失敗 後悔はないって 溜息の音を消している
Drowning out the sound of sighs, saying there is no failure or regret,

140
00:14:12,016 --> 00:14:16,516
現状に不安はない 飲み込んだ気取っていたんだ
I swallowed my lack of anxiety about the current state, pretending.

141
00:14:17,216 --> 00:14:19,816
忘れないように
So that I won't forget,

142
00:14:20,016 --> 00:14:24,016
金輪際 もう汚されないように
Never again, so that it won't be tainted.

143
00:14:26,016 --> 00:14:28,816
もっと笑っていたいんだもの
Because I want to laugh more,

144
00:14:28,816 --> 00:14:31,016
大人になっていく代償に
As the price of growing up.

145
00:14:31,016 --> 00:14:35,016
あなただってきっと思っているんでしょ
Surely you, too, must be thinking that.

146
00:14:35,216 --> 00:14:38,216
ちゃんと分かっていたんだけど
I understood it perfectly, but...

147
00:14:38,216 --> 00:14:41,016
心ってやっぱり正直だ
My heart is honest after all.

148
00:14:41,016 --> 00:14:46,516
薄れなくなった痛みを 感じたい気がしている
I feel like I want to experience the pain that won't fade.

149
00:14:47,016 --> 00:14:49,016
閉ざされたこの場所で
In this closed place,

150
00:14:49,016 --> 00:14:51,516
咲かせたってほら
Look, even if I make it bloom,

151
00:14:51,516 --> 00:14:53,016
解けないでいてよ
Please don't fade away.

152
00:14:53,016 --> 00:14:56,016
拒まない明日を待っている
I am waiting for a tomorrow that won't reject me,

153
00:14:56,516 --> 00:14:58,216
何度も
Countless times,

154
00:14:58,516 --> 00:15:00,016
奪われた
It was stolen.

155
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:05,124
取り戻した日々の傷跡に 誓った
I swore on the scars of the days I reclaimed.

156
00:15:13,424 --> 00:15:18,224
心よ響かせて
Let my heart resonate!

157
00:15:23,224 --> 00:15:28,024
心を響かせて
Let my heart resonate,

158
00:15:30,624 --> 00:15:32,424
ずっと
forever.

159
00:15:35,224 --> 00:15:41,024
ここだよ 響かせて 掲げたこの腕で Never mind でしょう
I'm right here! Let it resonate! With this raised arm, it's "never mind," right?

160
00:15:41,024 --> 00:15:46,024
右左だって 自由になっていく 何度も
Even left and right become free, over and over again!

161
00:15:47,424 --> 00:15:53,424
見失い、取り戻した日々の傷跡に 誓った
I swore on the scars of the days I lost and reclaimed.

162
00:16:12,824 --> 00:16:15,024
はい！
Yes! Phew...

163
00:16:15,524 --> 00:16:17,524
皆さん！
Everyone!

